WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.006 --> 00:00:09.946
The ogre carried the cage into the kitchen.

2
00:00:09.947 --> 00:00:13.272
He slammed it onto the counter.

3
00:00:13.273 --> 00:00:16.203
"Ouch!" Puss said.

4
00:00:16.204 --> 00:00:21.718
"Cook?" The ogre yelled for the cook.

5
00:00:21.719 --> 00:00:26.567
But no one came.

6
00:00:26.568 --> 00:00:30.873
So he began chopping onions himself.

7
00:00:30.874 --> 00:00:35.977
"This lunch will be delicious," he said.

8
00:00:35.978 --> 00:00:40.208
"I have to get out of here," Puss thought.

9
00:00:40.209 --> 00:00:44.397
He tried to bend the cage's bars.

10
00:00:44.398 --> 00:00:46.843
They were too stiff.

11
00:00:46.844 --> 00:00:49.589
Puss had another idea.

12
00:00:49.590 --> 00:00:57.055
He pretended to cry. "Oh, poor me!

13
00:00:57.056 --> 00:01:02.635
Now I'll never get to live with the princess!"

14
00:01:02.636 --> 00:01:05.101
The ogre stopped chopping.

15
00:01:05.102 --> 00:01:10.489
"You know the princess?" he asked.

16
00:01:10.490 --> 00:01:13.276
Puss sniffed.

17
00:01:13.277 --> 00:01:17.123
"My master is going to marry her."

18
00:01:17.124 --> 00:01:22.826
The ogre rubbed his chin.

19
00:01:22.827 --> 00:01:28.056
"So, you're going to be rich.

20
00:01:28.057 --> 00:01:31.768
Will you pay me if I let you go?"

21
00:01:31.769 --> 00:01:35.379
"But you're already rich," Puss said.

22
00:01:35.380 --> 00:01:40.912
The ogre shrugged. "I want more money."

23
00:01:40.913 --> 00:01:44.094
Puss pretended to think for a moment.

24
00:01:44.095 --> 00:01:48.598
Finally he said, "It's a deal."

25
00:01:48.599 --> 00:01:54.747
The ogre unlocked the cage door.

26
00:01:54.748 --> 00:01:57.676
Puss leaped past the ogre.

27
00:01:57.677 --> 00:02:00.189
He grabbed chopped onions.

28
00:02:00.190 --> 00:02:04.069
He threw them at the ogre's face.

29
00:02:04.070 --> 00:02:11.930
"Ow!" the ogre cried. "My eyes!"

30
00:02:11.931 --> 00:02:16.049
Puss dashed across the counter.

31
00:02:16.050 --> 00:02:22.205
"Ow!" he cried. "My paw!"

32
00:02:22.206 --> 00:02:25.532
He brushed against a knife.

33
00:02:25.533 --> 00:02:28.086
Puss didn't have time to stop.

34
00:02:28.087 --> 00:02:31.007
He kept running toward the door.

35
00:02:31.008 --> 00:02:35.749
Puss skidded to a stop. "Oh no!"

36
00:02:35.750 --> 00:02:40.570
A mean lion blocked the door!

